{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：01:07 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>警方在旺角搗破毒窟，其間有人墮樓死亡。周日（25日）晚上9時28分，警方有組織罪案及三合會調查科（O記）進行反毒品行動，於新填地街385至387號唐樓破門搜查一毒窟單位，其間一名42歲姓鄺男子疑從單位逃走，跑上大廈天台後卻失足墮樓。墮樓男子昏迷，倒臥在大廈對開地面，其後由救護車送往廣華醫院搶救，最終不治。</p>\n<img alt=\"多名軍裝警員到場調查事件。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/66b9c89c0ecca19bd1707c6875499231/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_16_16_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/623e8bef31eb734242ec2dbb4d7bfdba/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_16_16_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44cb0845713f39b6c130c0304e91160e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_16_16_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方在單位內帶走逾20名男女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27fb61704aff1b90d8a437013943728c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_16_45_12_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方在單位內帶走逾20名男女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b923e0e294382bee75ddd624e90b9000/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-25_at_16_45_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b52b19f85de7f922f582b5d40fe53287/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_16_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場大廈對開馬路旁邊遺下血迹，大批警員登樓調查，機動部隊人員亦到場支援。警方經調查後，在該單位內拘捕11名本地男子及10名本地女子（介乎28至70歲），並檢獲約52.3克可卡因、約11.4克「冰」毒、約32.3克海洛英、29粒咪達唑侖及一批吸食毒品工具；檢獲的毒品總市值共約8.3萬元。</p>\n<p>被捕人士分別涉嫌「經營毒窟」、「販運危險藥物」及「服食危險藥物」，被帶返警署扣留調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方駐守大廈出入口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e792322c795b277f73a98e193826b1ba/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_29_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35f473637412b9af4189e554cf7d9736/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓遺下血迹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8c547dcaa1738f5433131c466f650b88/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_27.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/022a1aebf02028dd5ac23509ac10ffe2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_25.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6897c646a995240becb87c76c0dea953/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b88598fb272df9bfa3a3d81577c96322/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_00_03_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.680140+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:08:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:53.545707+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:53.545707+00:00","content_hash":"1e26fdd7e95039c2c98f8e6f9c908619a80f7a11988c128a52068920a86c1c21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}